  "text": "Bowl | Louis Vincent 18cm(h) x 9.3cm(w) – Wood, clay and lacquer. – £325 At first glance, Bowl by Louis Vincent defies material expectations. Hand-turned on a lathe to an extraordinary thinness, the piece creates the illusion of ceramic or stoneware, yet it is crafted entirely from wood. This refined lightness contrasts beautifully with its surface, which is treated with clay sourced from London construction sites and finished with a natural lacquer. The result is a rich, earthy texture that evokes the visual weight of traditional ceramics while remaining strikingly delicate. Inspired by the forms of British studio ceramicists, Louis Vincent reinterprets these references through wood, pushing the boundaries of material perception and craftsmanship. Enquire now First & Last Name Email Phone Message Send Related Artworks Teoju by Jihyun Kim Chopsticks by Rickie Cheuk Chess Set by Jacob Chan Ginger Jar by Jacob Chan",
